1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,250
Three short surahs

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:05,560
the Prophet (peace be upon him) said they are enough for you against everything.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,200
‘Abdullah ibn Khubayb (may Allah be pleased with him) said: We went out on a rainy night, in deep darkness,

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:14,520
looking for the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) to lead us in prayer,

5
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:15,490
and we caught up with him.

6
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:17,020
He said: “Say.”

7
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,360
I said nothing.

8
00:00:18,790 --> 00:00:20,090
Then he said: “Say.”

9
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:21,550
I said nothing.

10
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:23,070
Then he said again: “Say.”

11
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:24,330
I said: “What should I say?”

12
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:30,320
He said: “Say Qul huwa Allahu ahad and the two Mu‘awwidhatayn, when you reach the evening and when you reach the morning, three times —

13
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:33,850
they will be enough for you against everything.” (Narrated by Abu Dawud and al-Tirmidhi)

14
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:37,400
Three short surahs you can recite in a minute, morning and evening,

15
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:40,730
and by Allah’s permission they become a fortress for you.

16
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:44,130
Take the means of treatment too, and see a doctor when needed.

17
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:47,600
Share this story with someone you love, and follow the channel.

